# Fast city test v3 (testspeed, 2026-11-08) -- NOT YET VALIDATED. The v2 walk into the street is chaotic: the
# same inputs end in two different alleys (ts-c2-* vs ts-rec-1/ts-bg-2/ts-rep-*; picture mean diff 8-28 at
# a32/a44), so its walk window measures different places. Cole stays on the anchor spot here; only the camera
# turns (right stick, fixed times) and each view is held still while it is measured:
#   0-12 s still: dock + street (Sami's ~52 fps scene)   12-13.5 pan right, 13.5-24 still   24-25.5 pan, 25.5-36 still
#   36-37.5 pan, 37.5-48 still
# Run: tools\fast.ps1 -Tag X -Steps tools\fast_city3.steps
#! seconds 200
#! anchor_range 55:100
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! windows 2:12,15:24,27:36,39:48
#! pad w12:0x800000:1.5,w24:0x800000:1.5,w36:0x800000:1.5
wait v_02_city_intro 120
sleep 2
waitimg city_hud 40,20,340,130 15 120
sleep 2
anchor
at 8
shot a8
at 20
shot a20
at 32
shot a32
at 44
shot a44
at 49
close
